title: milo_tutorial_step_1_brazier
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:1
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Look toward the firelight, traveler.
Milo: That brazier was lit for you. Walk where the embers point.
===

title: milo_tutorial_step_2_interact
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:2
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Press E to interact with the world.
Milo: Anything that hums, anything that shines — it wants a hand. Yours will do.
===

title: milo_tutorial_step_3_waypoint
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:3
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Follow the arrow. The buried cathedral is closer than it looks.
Milo: Mud's been over it a hundred years. Today, you and I lift the lid.
===

title: milo_tutorial_step_4_tune
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:4
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Press E at the green light.
Milo: That's a tuning node. Match its note and the stone remembers itself.
===

title: milo_tutorial_step_5_restored
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:5
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Look at it. Look at what you just did.
Milo: One building back from the silence. Eleven moons left, but you've got the knack now.
===

title: milo_tutorial_step_6_free
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:6
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Explore. You have buildings to wake.
Milo: I'll be near. Holler if the mud hollers back.
===

title: milo_tutorial_skipped
tags: character:Milo moon:1 beat:tutorial step:skip
---
<<tag character:Milo>>
Milo: Suit yourself. The valley's yours to read.
===
